Read the module manifest, nearest scoped AGENTS.md, module-architecture skill, and dependency reference before editing. Keep module-specific work in its owner and avoid base-to-module references.

Classify the change against `.agents/rules/fork-trajectory-priority.md` before editing a `Modules/**` path or any underscore owner dir. Prefer `Modules/Arcane` for Arcane-only behavior and `Content.Trauma.*` for upstream-compatible behavior.

Marker: none inside `Modules/Arcane/**`. For anything else, wrap the smallest changed block in Arcane form and see `.cursor/rules/core.mdc`.
